        <mxCell id="card-legend-notes" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;Large dashed frame: infra perimeter · small: functional group&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;⚠ Gx&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: docs and code disagree, see &quot;Gaps&quot;&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1760" y="450" width="460" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-rules" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#e11d48&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Per cluster&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;On-prem:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; one CiliumClusterwideNetworkPolicy per project, cnp-project-&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;-ingress. It allows the project&amp;#39;s namespaces, envoy-gateway-system, observability, cnpg-system and host / remote-node (probes). Everything else is dropped.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;EKS, GKE:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; one NetworkPolicy cnp-project-ingress per project namespace, same sources, no host rule. Enforced by the VPC CNI agent (enableNetworkPolicy) on EKS and Dataplane V2 on GKE.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Both policies exist only when features.workloads and features.networkIsolation are on (default true).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Live 18/10, EKS and GKE only:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; same namespace allowed, same project other namespace allowed, default to project blocked, kubelet probes OK, DNS and Internet egress OK.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Cloud perimeter:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; UDP 31820 only from vpn_source_cidrs, API :443 only from api_allowed_cidrs. Both: api_allowed_cidrs = the K3s egress 176.186.130.237/32. The operator gets there through the SOCKS proxy on pae-node-1. EKS API access entry for the operator only.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Inbound:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; guardrails refuse LoadBalancer Services and Ingress, cnp.sh down aborts if a LoadBalancer exists, GKE HTTP LB add-on disabled. Apps leave through outbound Cloudflare tunnels.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1740" y="540" width="500" height="600" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-relays" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d97706&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Tunnel relays and cloud guardrails&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;onprem-apps (ns cnp-vpn, EKS and GKE):&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; 18080 and 18082 from ns observability only, 18083 from ns argo-rollouts only, UDP 51820 from anywhere (the SG / firewall keeps it to the K3s egress). Namespace selectors: any pod in those namespaces qualifies.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Guardrails:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; three ValidatingAdmissionPolicies, Deny and failurePolicy Fail: cnp-deny-loadbalancer, cnp-deny-ingress, cnp-local-path-only (PVCs). Reason: no paid cloud resource.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;On-prem end:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; vminsert-writers and vmselect-readers admit the wireguard and wireguard-gcp pods; vmstorage takes only vminsert and vmselect.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;Gap&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; The Loki gateway has no NetworkPolicy: any pod reaches it, basic auth is the only check. vminsert takes the relayed writes with no credential.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Kyverno on clouds:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; disallow-latest-and-untagged-images, pod-security-restricted, require-resources-and-memory-limits. Enforce or Audit: not checked.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1240" y="1180" width="1000" height="300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-guard" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ea580c&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;GitOps guard rails&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Tenant AppProject &amp;lt;p&amp;gt;:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; blacklists cilium.io/*, NetworkPolicy, ResourceQuota and LimitRange. A tenant app cannot weaken or remove its own isolation. Destinations: only &amp;lt;p&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;app&amp;gt; namespaces on its target cloud.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Platform AppProject &amp;lt;p&amp;gt;-platform:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; only the chart cnp-project-base, which installs the policies. Destinations: &amp;lt;p&amp;gt;-system, plus the app namespaces on clouds; a few whitelisted cluster objects.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1240" y="1520" width="480" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-sources" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Sources&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• cnp-project-base/templates/{ccnp,networkpolicy,app-project}.yaml · infra-templates/templates/ · K3s/k8s/config/argocd · K3s/k8s/config/observability/{vm,loki}-networkpolicies&lt;br&gt;• Cloud/terraform/public/{aws/EKS,gcp/GKE}/main.tf (VPC CNI, SG, Dataplane V2, firewall) · */kubernetes/onprem-apps-netpol.yaml · platform/guardrails.yaml · platform/kyverno/policies&lt;br&gt;• Live matrix 18/10 on letestaws (EKS) and letestgcp (GKE).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1760" y="1520" width="480" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
